ERR11435634	PRJEB62094	ERP147176	SAMEA113428047	ERX10842942	Homo sapiens	MCF10A FBXW7-/- cl17 T0	Protocols: Inducible SpCas9 expressing cells were seeded for 1000x representation per sgRNA, and infected at a multiplicity of infection (MOI) of 0.3, to avoid multiple sgRNA infections per cell, using the previously published and validated genome-wide human lentiviral library (Kosuke Yusa Human GW CRISPR guide RNA library V1). After puromycin selection (1 µg/mL), cells were exposed to doxycycline for 3 days and harvested at day 0 (T0) and on day 14 (T1). Genomic DNA was extracted from the T=0 and T=1 samples using DNeasy Blood and Tissue Kit (Qiagen) as per manufacturers instructions. sgRNA sequence were amplified with Q5 polymerase (NEB) with the following primers Forward 5’- ACACTCTTTCCCTACACGACGCTCTTCCGATCTCTTGTGGAAAGGACGAAACA and Reverse 5’- TCGGCATTCCTGCTGAACCGCTCTTCCGATCTCTAAAGCGCATGCTCCAGAC.	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: Cancer-associated FBXW7 loss is synthetic lethal with pharmacological targeting of CDC7	AMPLICON	GENOMIC	PCR	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Inducible SpCas9 expressing cells were seeded for 1000x representation per sgRNA, and infected at a multiplicity of infection (MOI) of 0.3, to avoid multiple sgRNA infections per cell, using the previously published and validated genome-wide human lentiviral library (Kosuke Yusa Human GW CRISPR guide RNA library V1). After puromycin selection (1 µg/mL), cells were exposed to doxycycline for 3 days and harvested at day 0 (T0) and on day 14 (T1). Genomic DNA was extracted from the T=0 and T=1 samples using DNeasy Blood and Tissue Kit (Qiagen) as per manufacturers instructions. sgRNA sequence were amplified with Q5 polymerase (NEB) with the following primers Forward 5’- ACACTCTTTCCCTACACGACGCTCTTCCGATCTCTTGTGGAAAGGACGAAACA and Reverse 5’- TCGGCATTCCTGCTGAACCGCTCTTCCGATCTCTAAAGCGCATGCTCCAGAC.	194442009	3888840180	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/ERR114/034/ERR11435634/ERR11435634.fastq.gz	31ffc14efa28414d57f33